[{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>The diagrams below show the unit square, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"OABC\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and its image, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"O'A'B'C'\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, after a transformation. In each case, write down the matrix that represents this transformation:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.35/questions/assets/diagrams/135-q1a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.35/questions/assets/diagrams/135-q1b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.35/questions/assets/diagrams/135-q1c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;3&amp;2\\\\0&amp;2&amp;3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;a&amp;a+b&amp;b\\\\0&amp;2&amp;2+d&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;3&amp;2\\\\0&amp;2&amp;3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=1,\\ b=2,\\ c=2,\\ d=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;1\\\\3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;3&amp;4&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;a&amp;a+b&amp;b\\\\0&amp;3&amp;3+d&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1&amp;0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;3&amp;4&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=-1,\\ b=1,\\ c=3,\\ d=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;1\\\\3&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;-2\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1&amp;-3&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;a&amp;a+b&amp;b\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1+d&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-1&amp;-3&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=-1,\\ b=-2,\\ c=1,\\ d=-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;-2\\\\1&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>The diagrams below show the triangle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ABC\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and its image, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A'B'C'\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, after a transformation. In each case, write down the matrix that represents this transformation:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.35/questions/assets/diagrams/135-q2a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.35/questions/assets/diagrams/135-q2b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.35/questions/assets/diagrams/135-q2c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;b\\\\c&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0&amp;1\\\\1&amp;2&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;4\\\\1&amp;2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}b&amp;2b&amp;a+2b\\\\d&amp;2d&amp;c+2d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;2&amp;4\\\\1&amp;2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"b=1,\\ d=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"a+2\\times1=4\\Rightarrow a=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"c+2\\times1=1\\Rightarrow c=-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\-1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;b\\\\c&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;2&amp;4\\\\2&amp;3&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-2&amp;2\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}2b&amp;2a+3b&amp;4a\\\\2d&amp;2c+3d&amp;4c\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-2&amp;2\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4a=2\\Rightarrow a=\\frac12\\qquad2b=-2\\Rightarrow b=-1\\qquad4c=-2\\Rightarrow c=-\\frac12\\qquad2d=0\\Rightarrow d=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac12&amp;-1\\\\-\\frac12&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;b\\\\c&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-2&amp;2\\\\-2&amp;4&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;3&amp;-3\\\\3&amp;-6&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}2a-2b&amp;-2a+4b&amp;2a+2b\\\\2c-2d&amp;-2c+4d&amp;2c+2d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;3&amp;-3\\\\3&amp;-6&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2a-2b=-3\\quad(1)\\qquad-2a+4b=3\\quad(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=-\\frac32\\text{ and }b=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2c-2d=3\\quad(3)\\qquad-2c+4d=-6\\quad(4)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore c=0\\text{ and }d=-\\frac32\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac32&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-\\frac32\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Find the image of the coordinates <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> after the following linear transformations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\5&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;2\\\\3&amp;-4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So (2, 3).</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\9\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So (4, 9).</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;3\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}11\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So (11, 3).</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\5&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\13\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So (2, 13).</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}5\\\\5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So (5, 5).</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;2\\\\3&amp;-4\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}4\\\\-6\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So (4, -6).</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>A shape is transformed by the following matrices. Describe what happens in each case:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>This is the identity matrix. All points get mapped to themselves.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>This is the zero matrix. All points get mapped to the origin, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Find the image of the coordinates <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A(-3,-5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B(2,-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> after the following linear transformations:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;2\\\\2&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;1\\\\-4&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1.2&amp;3.6\\\\-2.8&amp;-1.9\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;7.7\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;2\\\\2&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2\\\\-5&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-16&amp;2\\\\-16&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A'(-16,-16)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B'(2,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;1\\\\-4&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2\\\\-5&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;-7\\\\2&amp;-10\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A'(4,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B'(-7,-10)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1.2&amp;3.6\\\\-2.8&amp;-1.9\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2\\\\-5&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-21.6&amp;-1.2\\\\17.9&amp;-3.7\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A'(-21.6,17.9)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B'(-1.2,-3.7)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;7.7\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2\\\\-5&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;0\\\\-38.5&amp;-7.7\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A'(0,-38.5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B'(0,-7.7)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>The matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;-3\\\\4&amp;-8\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> represents the transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> which transforms the points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(1,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q(-3,4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to the points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P'\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q'\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the distance <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"PQ\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find the distance <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P'Q'\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"PQ=\\sqrt{(4-2)^2+(-3-1)^2}=\\sqrt{20}=2\\sqrt5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;-3\\\\4&amp;-8\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-3\\\\2&amp;4\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;-27\\\\-12&amp;-44\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P'(-1,-12)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q'(-27,-44)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"P'Q'=\\sqrt{(-44-(-12))^2+(-27-(-1))^2}=\\sqrt{1700}=10\\sqrt{17}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Find the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\times2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> matrix that maps <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4,-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2,-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(7,1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-7,-11)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> respectively.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;b\\\\c&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;-2\\\\-1&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;-7\\\\1&amp;-11\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}4a-b&amp;-2a-3b\\\\4c-d&amp;-2c-3d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}7&amp;-7\\\\1&amp;-11\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4a-b=7\\quad(1)\\qquad-2a-3b=-7\\quad(2)\\qquad\\therefore a=2\\text{ and }b=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4c-d=1\\quad(3)\\qquad-2c-3d=-11\\quad(4)\\qquad\\therefore c=1\\text{ and }d=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1\\\\1&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Find the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\times2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> matrix that maps <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(5,6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-37,50)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-8,3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> respectively.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;b\\\\c&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}5&amp;2\\\\6&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-37&amp;-8\\\\50&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}5a+6b&amp;2a-b\\\\5c+6d&amp;2c-d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-37&amp;-8\\\\50&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"5a+6b=-37\\quad(1)\\qquad2a-b=-8\\quad(2)\\qquad\\therefore a=-5\\text{ and }b=-2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"5c+6d=50\\quad(3)\\qquad2c-d=3\\quad(4)\\qquad\\therefore c=4\\text{ and }d=5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-5&amp;-2\\\\4&amp;5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Find the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\times2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> matrix that swaps the coordinates <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;b\\\\c&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}a+2b&amp;a+b\\\\c+2d&amp;c+d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1\\\\1&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"a+2b=1\\quad(1)\\qquad a+b=1\\quad(2)\\qquad\\therefore a=1\\text{ and }b=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"c+2d=1\\quad(3)\\qquad c+d=2\\quad(4)\\qquad\\therefore c=3\\text{ and }d=-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0\\\\3&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}6&amp;8\\\\-2&amp;9\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(a,b)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(46,78)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}6&amp;8\\\\-2&amp;9\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a\\\\b\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}46\\\\78\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}6a+8b\\\\-2a+9b\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}46\\\\78\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"6a+8b=46\\quad(1)\\qquad-2a+9b=78\\quad(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Solve (1) and (2) to give <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;10\\\\3&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(a,b)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(c,d)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(8,-5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(76,13)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> respectively, find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;10\\\\3&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;c\\\\b&amp;d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}8&amp;76\\\\-5&amp;13\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}4a+10b&amp;4c+10d\\\\3a+2b&amp;3c+2d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}8&amp;76\\\\-5&amp;13\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4a+10b=8\\quad(1)\\qquad3a+2b=-5\\quad(2)\\qquad\\therefore a=-3\\text{ and }b=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4c+10d=76\\quad(3)\\qquad3c+2d=13\\quad(4)\\qquad\\therefore c=-1\\text{ and }d=8\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;-1\\\\2&amp;8\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;k\\\\-4&amp;2k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(a,16)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-23,-236)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;k\\\\-4&amp;2k\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a\\\\16\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-23\\\\-236\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}3a+16k\\\\-4a+32k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-23\\\\-236\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3a+16k=-23\\quad(1)\\qquad-4a+32k=-236\\quad(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Solve (1) and (2) to give <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=19\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}4k&amp;-5k\\\\8k&amp;3k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k,8)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-52k,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is nonzero, find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}4k&amp;-5k\\\\8k&amp;3k\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}k\\\\8\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-52k\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}4k^2-40k\\\\8k^2+24k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-52k\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4k^2-40k=-52k\\Rightarrow4k^2+12k=0\\Rightarrow k^2+3k=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow k(k+3)=0\\Rightarrow k=0\\text{ or }k=-3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"8k^2+24k=0\\Rightarrow k^2+3k=0\\Rightarrow k(k+3)=0\\Rightarrow k=0\\text{ or }k=-3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\\ne0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, we must have that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k+3&amp;k-5\\\\k-7&amp;k+1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3k,k-6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(44k+8,17k+5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}k+3&amp;k-5\\\\k-7&amp;k+1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}3k\\\\k-6\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}44k+8\\\\17k+5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}(k+3)\\times3k+(k-5)\\times(k-6)\\\\(k-7)\\times3k+(k+1)\\times(k-6)\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}44k+8\\\\17k+5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3k^2+9k+k^2-11k+30=44k+8\\Rightarrow4k^2-46k+22=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2k^2-23k+11=0\\Rightarrow(2k-1)(k-11)=0\\Rightarrow k=\\frac12\\text{ or }k=11\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3k^2-21k+k^2-5k-6=17k+5\\Rightarrow4k^2-43k-11=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(4k+1)(k-11)=0\\Rightarrow k=-\\frac14\\text{ or }k=11\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore k=11\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;2\\\\-1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(1,k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q(k,1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to the points <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P'\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q'\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where the distance between <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P'\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q'\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2\\sqrt5\" data-display=\"false\"></span> units, find the possible values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;2\\\\-1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\k\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2k+3\\\\k-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;2\\\\-1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}k\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3k+2\\\\1-k\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P'(2k+3,k-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q'(3k+2,1-k)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"P'Q'=2\\sqrt5\\Rightarrow((3k+2)-(2k+3))^2+((1-k)-(k-1))^2=(2\\sqrt5)^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow(k-1)^2+(2-2k)^2=20\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow k^2-2k+1+4-8k+4k^2=20\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow5k^2-10k-15=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow k^2-2k-3=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(k-3)(k+1)=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow k=-1\\text{ or }k=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q16","number":16,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}8&amp;-6\\\\4&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps any point onto the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the equation of the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"l\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Choose two points, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for example, and find their images:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}8&amp;-6\\\\4&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}8\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}8&amp;-6\\\\4&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-6\\\\-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>The equation of the line passing through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(8,4)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-6,-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y-4=\\frac{-3-4}{-6-8}(x-8)\\Rightarrow y-4=\\frac12(x-8)\\Rightarrow y=\\frac12x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q17","number":17,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-3\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto the line with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=ax\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-3\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\x\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\aX\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}x-3x\\\\2x+x\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\aX\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}-2x\\\\3x\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\aX\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"X=-2x\\qquad aX=3x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a(-2x)=3x\\Rightarrow a=-\\frac32\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>The image of the line is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac32x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<p>Find the image of two points that lie on the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-3\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-2\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;-3\\\\2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-4\\\\6\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Find the equation of the line that passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-2,3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-4,6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"m=\\frac{6-3}{-4-(-2)}=\\frac3{-2}=-\\frac32\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore y-3=-\\frac32(x+2)\\Rightarrow y=-\\frac32x,\\text{ so }a=-\\frac32\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q18","number":18,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-5\\\\8&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto the line with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=ax+b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-5\\\\8&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\x-2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\aX+b\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}-2x-5(x-2)\\\\8x-3(x-2)\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\aX+b\\end{pmatrix}\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}10-7x\\\\6+5x\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\aX+b\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"X=10-7x\\qquad aX+b=6+5x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a(10-7x)+b=6+5x\\Rightarrow10a+b-7ax=6+5x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"10a+b=6\\quad(1)\\qquad-7a=5\\quad(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Solve (1) and (2) to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-\\frac57\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=\\frac{92}{7}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>The image of the line is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac57x+\\frac{92}{7}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-\\frac57\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=\\frac{92}{7}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<p>Find the image of two points that lie on the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-5\\\\8&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-4\\\\16\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-5\\\\8&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}10\\\\6\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Find the equation of the line that passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-4,16)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(10,6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"m=\\frac{16-6}{-4-10}=\\frac{10}{-14}=-\\frac57\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore y-16=-\\frac57(x+4)\\Rightarrow y=-\\frac57x+\\frac{92}{7}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-\\frac57\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=\\frac{92}{7}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q19","number":19,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;3\\\\2&amp;b\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto the line with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3x+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;3\\\\2&amp;b\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\2x+1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\3X+2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}ax+3(2x+1)\\\\2x+b(2x+1)\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\3X+2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}(a+6)x+3\\\\(2+2b)x+b\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\3X+2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"X=(a+6)x+3\\qquad3X+2=(2+2b)x+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore3((a+6)x+3)+2=(2+2b)x+b\\Rightarrow(3a+18)x+11=(2+2b)x+b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3a+18=2+2b\\quad(1)\\qquad11=b\\quad(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Substitute (2) into (1):</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3a+18=2+2(11)\\Rightarrow a=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=2\\text{ and }b=11\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternative Method:</p>","<p>Find the image of two points that lie on the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=2x+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;3\\\\2&amp;b\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\b\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}a&amp;3\\\\2&amp;b\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}a+9\\\\2+3b\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Substitute <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3,b)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(a+9,2+3b)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> into <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=3x+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(3,b)\\Rightarrow b=3(3)+2\\Rightarrow b=11\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"(a+9,2+3b)\\Rightarrow2+3b=3(a+9)+2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow2+3(11)=3a+29\\Rightarrow a=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=2\\text{ and }b=11\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q20","number":20,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-3\\\\3&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps the circle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(x-4)^2+y^2=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto the circle <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C'\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the equation of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C'\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(4,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the centre of the circle.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> lies on the circle.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-3\\\\3&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;2\\\\0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-6\\\\12&amp;6\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C'\" data-display=\"false\"></span> has centre <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(0,12)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-6,6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"r'=\\sqrt{(-6-0)^2+(6-12)^2}=\\sqrt{72}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore C'\\text{ has equation }x^2+(y-12)^2=72\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q21","number":21,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps the line <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x^2+2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto the line with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=ax^2+bx+c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\x^2+2x\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\aX^2+bX+c\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}-2x\\\\-3x^2-6x\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\aX^2+bX+c\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"X=-2x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"aX^2+bX+c=-3x^2-6x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a(-2x)^2+b(-2x)+c=-3x^2-6x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow4ax^2-2bx+c=-3x^2-6x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4a=-3\\Rightarrow a=-\\frac34\\qquad-2b=-6\\Rightarrow b=3\\qquad c=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>The image of the curve is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac34x^2+3x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=-\\frac34\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.35-q22","number":22,"question":"<p>Given the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-2\\\\6&amp;-6\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> maps the curve <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac1x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> onto the curve with equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"ax^2-by^2=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, find the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;-2\\\\6&amp;-6\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\\\frac1x\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\\\sqrt{\\frac abX^2-\\frac1b}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}-2x-\\frac2x\\\\6x-\\frac6x\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}X\\\\\\sqrt{\\frac abX^2-\\frac1b}\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"X=-2x-\\frac2x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sqrt{\\frac abX^2-\\frac1b}=6x-\\frac6x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\sqrt{\\frac ab(-2x-\\frac2x)^2-\\frac1b}=6x-\\frac6x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow\\frac ab(-2x-\\frac2x)^2-\\frac1b=(6x-\\frac6x)^2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow a(4x^2+8+\\frac4{x^2})-1=b(36x^2-72+\\frac{36}{x^2})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\Rightarrow4ax^2+\\frac{4a}{x^2}+8a-1=36bx^2+\\frac{36b}{x^2}-72b\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"4a=36b\\Rightarrow a-9b=0\\quad(1)\\qquad8a-1=-72b\\Rightarrow8a+72b=1\\quad(2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Solve (1) and (2) to get <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=\\frac1{16}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=\\frac1{144}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>The image of the curve is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{16}x^2-\\frac1{144}y^2=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=\\frac1{16}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=\\frac1{144}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]}]